@startuml
left to right direction
title DETM 2-Minute Architecture Explainer

actor "New Developer" as Dev
component "main.py\nLauncher" as Launcher
component "Run Mode\n(napari | headless | shell)" as Mode
component "Orchestrator\n(session/scheduler/ui_runtime)" as Orch
component "detm.runtime.api\n(L0 core)" as API
component "Observables\n(signature/events/cost/quality)" as Obs
component "EventBus\n(sync, ordered)" as Bus
component "Subscribers\n(trace/watch/commit/viz/fabric)" as Subs
component "Outputs\nUI files transport" as Out

Dev --> Launcher : start run
Launcher --> Mode
Mode --> Orch
Orch --> API : step/reset/digest
API --> Obs
Orch --> Bus : publish(reset/step/tick/signal)
Bus --> Subs
Subs --> Out

note bottom of API
Core/app separation:
- detm/* = simulation core
- detm_app/* = orchestration, UI, IO
end note

@enduml
